OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price 'angry' when told of
OL,4,Aex's rape claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenage girl allegedly
OL,7,Fraped by Katie Price's then-husband
OL,8,Fsaid she felt the former glamour model
OL,9,Fwas "angry" about the allegation and
OL,10,F"didn't care" about her daughter, a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FPrice's ex-husband Kieran Hayler is on
OL,14,Ftrial at Lewes Crown Court accused of
OL,15,Fthree counts of rape and one of sexual
OL,16,Fassault against the then 13-year-old
OL,17,Fgirl in West Sussex in 2016, all of
OL,18,Fwhich he denies.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
