OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price 'angry' when told of
OL,4,Aex's rape claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence in court on Thursday,
OL,7,Fthe complainant's mother said when she
OL,8,Ftold Price about the allegations, "she
OL,9,Fwas quite angry and I didn't feel she
OL,10,Fwas particularly upset for [the
OL,11,Fcomplainant]".
OL,13,FShe added: "I didn't feel she cared
OL,14,Fabout my daughter."
